{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":16,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-8","storyName":"金错刀","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"天镜阁中，莫佚声称太尉的目的是夺取书刀，篡改历史，以魏彦吾的性命开启“不反”，而椿作为司岁台的首脑却不愿阻止，反而从旁协助。叶影簌簌，烛火掩映，战局一触即发。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":14,"next":16,"characters":["司岁台监正","左乐","椿","莫佚","陈","陈昭芊"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g9_oldbattlefield","duration":"7","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","xFrom":"80","xTo":"-80","id":7},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"4","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":12},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","isblock":"true","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandftsingle","volume":"0.6","block":"false","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","text":"","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"这身衣服很适合你。","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"左、左乐见过监正大人！","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"新人首日报道，倒也不必这么严肃拘谨。未免折了身上的少年气。放轻松些。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"是！左乐谨记！","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"......","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"左乐，你可知这里是什么地方？","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"“有兽死绥，路绝山隈。”此处乃大狩猎时，我们围杀一头巨兽的战场。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"m","text":"","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"但......","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"左乐顿住话头，不知道自己还能不能接着这个“但”字讲下去，看到眼前人耐心的目光，才继续往下说。","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这里同样也是，无数将士、百姓......那些活生生的人，化作书页之间，一行行冰冷数字的坟场。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"许多比你更年长的秉烛人，也没能看到这一层。","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"“明烛以驱巨兽之影，巡游以察社稷之患。”","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"最早的秉烛人，手持炬火查明了巨兽的存在，才有后来炎国从神明手中夺来生机的那场战争。","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"时至今日，依然只有极少数人才知晓巨兽的存在，寻常百姓更是无从得知。","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"正因如此，秉烛人手中的烛火才更应于阴影遮蔽处，长明不灭。","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"左乐定当竭尽全力，护万民安生。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"你能有这份决心，很好。不过，我仍需再问问你——在你看来，巨兽，究竟是什么？","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"那些行走于山川四时之间，被我们密切注视着的代理人，祂们......又是什么？","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"人心尚不可测，况夫兽心。祂们之中，固然有因一时兴起或片刻真心，曾予大炎以助力之辈。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"但权衡利弊，归根结底，祂们......终究是与我们不同的人......敌人。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"敌人吗......","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"......敌人。","id":61},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":64},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"dialog","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0.1","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","screenadapt":"coverall","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"animtext","id":74,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>望日前一日 酉时</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":75},{"type":"animtextclean","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":77},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_sys_act23side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":78,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","text":"","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正大人......","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","text":"","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"您......怎么在这儿？","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","text":"","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这句话难道不是应该我来问你？","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"界园镇抚过后，界园里的信物，你送到了哪里？","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","text":"","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"司岁台情况有异，再加上天镜阁字伥横行，我本想等情况明朗，再请您当面定夺......","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"那便在此交接吧。","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我听说今年从界园中带出来的并非每年恒例的玉尺，具体究竟是何物，待我回司岁台详细查看。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","text":"","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这......","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"1","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-30,0","duration":"0.8","block":"true","text":"","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"只是出于潜意识中的判断，面对熟悉的顶头上司，左乐向后退了一步。","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......真稀奇，左秉烛竟也会有抗命不遵的一天。","id":105},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"别来这一套——你就是椿，司岁台的头儿？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"竟然能在天镜阁中见到山海众，如不是这特殊时期，巡防营上下都该重罚——而且看你的服装，似乎是等级不低。","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这位又是......陈家小姐？","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......你是左乐的上司？","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"忝居其位，但也责无旁贷。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"你在这儿干什么？就等着我们来自投罗网？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","text":"","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"很遗憾，我要等的并不是你们。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"左乐，把信物交上来，然后你就可以和朋友们走了。你交结匪类一事，我们可以过后再说。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"我还以为你要让他当场将我拿下，好将功折罪呢。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"大炎朝堂，不行此江湖草莽之事。","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#5$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"说得好听。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"怂恿颉入岁陵，让这个对大炎而言更加危险的代理人代望而死，换取自己在大炎一步登天的资本，不是你，还有谁？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"也不知道衍兽若是泉下有知，会不会为了自己有这样一个后人脸红！","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1","text":"","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"莫佚，监正不是这样的人！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"不是？她若不是，为什么颉死后没多久，她就接任了监正的位置？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......盗匪的眼里，也就只有盗匪。","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你最好住口，以你的身份，不配提起她的名字。","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","text":"","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"大炎朝堂从不会因一人一物而徘徊止步。一切行事所为，唯一的衡量标准，从来都只有大炎的利益。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"大炎的利益？","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","text":"","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"看来陈家小姐也有话要说。","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","text":"","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"无妨，看在左乐冒着巨大风险从界园带出此物的功绩上，我给你们三分钟的时间。","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","text":"","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"反正我也有人要等。你们问完想问的问题，留下信物，然后离开便是。","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.8","isblock":"true","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"等人？","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"是啊，等人。","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"你等的......是那一位掌握钥匙的代理人？","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......何以见得？","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"如今百灶城中伥怪横行，可真正来从根源上处理字伥的，只有未经命令的左乐一个人。","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"就算在魏彦吾管理最松懈时，龙门近卫局都不会如此懈怠。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"更何况，你一见到左乐，问的不是字伥如何，反而向他索要界园的信物......完全没将自己的职责放在心上。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"司岁台不是警察局。","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"除了司岁台，百灶还有谁最适合处理字伥造成的混乱？","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"果然，你与太尉的目的当然一致......你们要的是那柄书刀。","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"而假如莫佚没有说谎，此刻百灶城内，和那柄书刀关系最近的，只有均。","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"不愧是龙门近卫局的高级警司......","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"为什么要协助太尉图谋不轨？你们究竟要对魏彦吾做什么？还是说，你们已经和他联手？","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"图谋不轨？","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......陈家小姐，你或许曾经是一位优秀的警司，可是为天下计的大事，还轮不到你来插手。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#10$2","focus":"l","text":"","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我到过一些地方，也看过一些故事。你的话，没必要讲得这么冠冕堂皇。","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"若你们的图谋真为天下计，那明明白白讲清即可。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"唯独朋党门阀相互倾轧，才会在旁人问起缘由时动辄提起天下大计......实际上，动辄提及天下，不过是顾左右而言他罢了。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我劝陈家小姐慎言。大炎政务何其繁复，牵一发而动全身。朝中官员各持政见，是再正常不过的事。你口中所说的话，轻慢了所有人。","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"而司岁台千年来的职责从来只有一件事，那就是在巨兽一事上，为大炎做最好的选择。其余考量，司岁台还从来没有放在心上过。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"就算太尉所为确实偶有过激，可非常之时，自有非常之法。此番取用书刀，亦非作乱犯上。","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"那他究竟打算做什么——","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......","id":205},{"type":"dialog","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"到这一步，这个老不死的精灵应该是无论如何都不愿意说了——那就由我来替她说吧。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"和我猜的应该也丝毫不差，那个太尉只想用书刀删削历史，以真龙一人的性命为代价，彻底消灭岁兽。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"？！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#4$2","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"这是何意......真龙的性命，如何能消灭巨兽？","id":218},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"哦，刚才话说了一半......早在千年前，那位祖师爷寻找到了一枚源石，将它作为结束大狩猎的致胜武器献给真龙。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#10$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"大概是那位真龙意识到了这件宝物的重要性，便请方士以秘术将源石与真龙血脉紧密相连。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#10$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"无论何时，只有在位真龙一人能够使用那枚源石。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"那位霸道的真龙也算有点良心，大概是怕子孙后代滥用权力，于是又给秘术上加了一道条件——","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"凡是想要全力启用源石的，都得以真龙本人的性命为代价......故名曰“不反”。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"谁又说真龙的性命，非要来自当今圣上不可呢？若是只为了造反，太尉又何必苦心孤诣，要拿这把书刀？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1","id":233},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"所以，你是说太尉要用书刀改的是......当今真龙究竟是谁的记载？！","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"“太师使皇子弑君。”","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"那一晚的真相到底如何，是谁调走了御林卫？又是谁步入了宫闼？这些事情，各级案宗均未载明......","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"这便意味着，仍有人可凭借书刀，重订那个夜晚的记述。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"如若史书所载、“不反”认定的“当朝真龙”成了魏公，那么，“真龙一人的性命”，自然就是魏公的性命。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#5$2","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"——！","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我本念在你年轻......心想就算误入歧途，也总有挽回余地。","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"现在看来，是断然不能放你这条生路了。","id":252},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"哦？“光明磊落”的形象终于装不下去了？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","volume":"1","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":262},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1","text":"","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正大人！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"左乐，交出信物，后面的事便与你无关！","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","text":"","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正大人，如果莫佚说的这些都非虚言......这样的手段，我无法认同。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","text":"","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......恕难从命。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我绝不想毁坏这天镜阁的一砖一瓦......不要逼我。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......不用逼他。那信物在我身上——","id":284},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_leavesfalling","layer":"1","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","volume":"0.5","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plantwither","volume":"1","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"数叶寒枫蓦然截断陈的视线，恍惚之间，烛火摇曳。","id":292},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"150,0","id":294},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_3","volume":"1","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":296},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.4","focus":"all","isblock":"false","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.3","focus":"all","isblock":"true","id":300},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_fist_hit_01","rox":"0","roy":"0","roz":"0","layer":"1","id":301},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchairwall","volume":"0.5","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"bgeffect","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":307},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ftrub","volume":"0.8","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-250,-10","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"陈本打算后退出招，莫佚却抢上一步，挡下了椿的攻击。","id":312},{"type":"dialog","id":313},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","posfrom":"0,-10","posto":"0,0","isblock":"true","duration":"0.8","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"我看清楚了哦——原来司岁台的监正大人也会像盗匪一样趁虚偷袭。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"世事如棋，落子贵在果决。言语处尚可周旋含蓄，但破局之时，可容不得优柔寡断。","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","text":"","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正大人......","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","text":"","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我此前不是没查阅过书刀相关的卷宗。在颉手中，它的确能删削历史，甚至让天下震动。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","text":"","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"可我们不是代理人。我们篡改后的史册，绝难长久保存！","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"启动“不反”，一瞬足矣。","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"更何况......","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"更何况，经此一役，大炎境内便不再留有一个污名缠身的废太子，只会留下一位清清白白的当朝真龙，是吗？","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"那不是司岁台要担心的事情。","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"在她死后，大炎的历史本就已经千疮百孔，也不差修改的这一笔——","id":336},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","text":"","id":337},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezeblow_amb","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":338},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#5$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"你就这般笃定，历史......无法被我们如实记述？！","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"陈昭芊......天镜阁的典水官？","id":343},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$dignified_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":344,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","text":"","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正，我也想问您......","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","text":"","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"您曾和颉一起在那间办公室里修史多年，怎么到头来......却成了帮助篡改历史的人？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"炎国文献，向分经史子集四部。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"史子二部看似分明，可即便是那位被尊为史圣的先师，其笔下的著作，最初，也只是子部的一家之书。","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"而其后来者，宗法其笔墨写就的一家之言，说到底，也仍旧是炎家之言。","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"笔墨丹青，终究是事后的追记。至于那些事情的真相，早已湮没于时间的缝隙中。","id":356},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"你凭什么这么说？","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"我不信你未读过史圣的书记——陷于囹圄，遍尝酷刑，却仍为不平而鸣，秉笔直书。","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","text":"","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"我不信你未翻过天镜阁的史典——百千先师，呕心沥血，只为端正始末是非，一字褒贬。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"我不信你未听过在野之史家——参互辨定，考证详验，不慕朝廷荣禄，只求匡扶世人的公义。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#10$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"我亲眼看到家中的长辈，为了书写真相，不......仅仅是为了恪守心中的一个“诚”字，便冻毙于茫茫雪原！","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#10$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"敢问监正大人，这些以血肉之躯记录历史的人，这些甘愿以身为灯，只求昭彻一瞬清明的人——","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#5$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"在您眼中，究竟算得了什么？","id":371},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$1","id":373},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......执笔者。","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"在执笔者面前，始末真相、是是非非，这些东西，往往都取决于立场，而不在乎对错。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"年轻人，你也应该知道——纵使是在万千先师楷模的斧正之下，我们所读到的历史，仍旧充斥着虚饰、避讳与谎言。","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"但更讽刺的是......这些东西，甚至并不能被称为“恶”。","id":382},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","volume":"1","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"卷曲的叶片叩出清响，似在诘问，又似在叹息。","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"陈昭芊，退下。你不是秉烛人，不是山海众，不是废太子的外甥女。你不该来蹚这摊浑水。","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#4$1","text":"","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"我——","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"她走后，太史阁可曾真正担负起撰史之职？天镜阁又可曾真正尽到辨正之责？","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"试问太史后人，若由你接掌史官之位，你就能保证字字确凿，万世不移？","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#9$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"我......","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你不敢承担这份责任。","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#10$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"......","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我知道你的事。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"早些年，你曾想从自家家史修起，以身作则，一扫史镜二阁沉溺考据古史，却不愿修著近史之弊，所以才甘愿来天镜阁当一个冗官。","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"十年，百年，千年。你未曾如她那般在漫长的时间尺度上跋涉，又如何能够宣称，自己可为历史代言？","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"退下吧。","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plantwither","volume":"1","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"丹枫凄紧。","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"和刚刚不同，这次，没人看得清椿的动作——或者，她只是轻轻甩了甩袖子，陈昭芊就瘫倒在地。","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":416},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#13$2","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-80,0","duration":"0.3","isblock":"false","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"昭芊？！","id":421},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#13$2","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"-80,-50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"false","id":424},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","text":"","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正，您——","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"只是昏倒罢了，不出一个时辰就会醒来。她没理由越陷越深。她只是个不幸的普通人，不该像你们一样，不该像我一样。","id":429},{"type":"dialog","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我听说，精灵是很长寿的种族。","id":434},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"的确。","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#13$2","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"所以你不相信历史，不相信人心中会有恒久的公义，只是因为那个和你在漫长的时间里并肩的人......因你而死？","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这不是你该打听的事情，陈晖洁。","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"作为精灵，你不清楚自己从何而来，不清楚这片大地上是否尚有同类，更不清楚自己的归宿会落于何处——","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我的过往、将来，都一直与大炎同行。","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"与大炎同行，便意味着将同道推入深渊吗？","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"让她代替望赴死，乃是权衡利害得失后最允当的决策，这件事不容置疑！","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"编修青简，撰录岁月......岁月，“岁月”二字，谁人不骇其力？","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#12$1","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"“兽与厚土行”，而她更进一步。她的力量植根于文字，与书史共生。炎国文脉不绝，她的力量便会随之累积，永无止息。","id":452},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$1","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"如若就此放任，最终，会孕育出何等恐怖的怪物？何等比“岁”本身，更为可怖的存在？","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"诚然......我敬她，亦视她为友人、知己。可大炎的安危，绝不该因我个人的一己之私，经受倾覆之险。","id":456},{"type":"dialog","id":457},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我见过你这样的人......舍弃旧友，却又祈祷故人入梦，不为重逢，却为了求得他们的宽恕。","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$1","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"司岁台的头儿，若眼前便有一道能让你再见到她的解法......","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我警告你们，不要为了一个痴人的狂想，将千百万人的安危视作儿戏。","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"望执意再入岁陵，断然不可能只是为了除“岁”。","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"他让你们从界园中带出来的东西，想来也一定和他复活亡者的疯狂计划相关。","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#5$1","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"我倒有些意外......我还以为，你作为那位的秉烛人时和她的关系应该不差才对。","id":472,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"你难道就一点都不希望他的计划能够成功？","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#9$1","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"一百二十年前他就已经失败，一百二十年后，他仍旧会败。放任他独断专行，只会招致更多的祸患。","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#9$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你们要我如何相信一个将天地众生当作棋枰棋子的疯子，如何相信一个害死姐妹的罪人......","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#9$1","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你要我如何相信一头巨兽的执念？","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"就凭他与你一样，是行走过山川四时，誓愿融入这片大地、于斯耕植的“人”。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$1","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"“人”？","id":484},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$1","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"人之为人，有死有生。唯此须臾如烛火，方映出存在的光芒。","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$1","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"她死了，她作为人已经活过。是望要逆天而行，惊扰死者的安寝。","id":488},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$1","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"纵使他的妄想可以成真，你们又要如何断定，那苏醒的东西就是故人，而非受其驱使、空余形骸的“伥”？","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"你只是不愿相信罢了。","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"事情总会朝着人们不希望的方向发展。","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"结果可能不尽人意，但若是被愧疚钳制双脚，连迈出一步的勇气都没有，未免太过......","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......懦弱。","id":498},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":499},{"type":"dialog","id":500},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#9$1","id":501},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plantwither","volume":"1","id":502},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":503},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$indust_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_bat_indust_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":504,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#9$1","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......陈晖洁，你口才很好，可我看不出，你又能如何践行你口中的大义。","id":506},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#7$1","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"信物，钥匙，我此行只为这二物。","id":508},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"若是还要巧舌如簧，搬弄是非，我便只好先将你们击溃，再行处置了。","id":510},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"别说大话，谁击倒谁还不一定呢。","id":512,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$1","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"左乐，你又如何打算？","id":514},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","text":"","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......得罪。","id":516,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......哈哈，好、好。","id":518},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":519},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"近墨者黑，左秉烛倒真交了些好朋友。","id":520},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$1","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"出招吧。","id":522},{"type":"dialog","id":523},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":524},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":525},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":526},{"type":"charslot","id":527},{"type":"background","id":528},{"type":"image","id":529}],"characters":["司岁台监正","左乐","椿","莫佚","陈","陈昭芊"]}